# [DD-13b.W1.1 r46sem finding 15] A LINE OF PURE WHITESPACE between two
# cases. docs/spec/rxt_format.md: "Blank lines are ignored", with no
# carve-out for a line that is not literally zero bytes. Legs A and B
# already skip it; leg C used to raise ("a pattern block's lines are
# not indented") on the ordinary indentation check, because its blank-
# line test was an exact `line == ''`.
pattern a+
m "aaa" 0 3
   
n "b"
